    "long_instructions": "#Building Reusable Prompts with CHAT, Part 2\r\n1.  **Hone**: In `CHAT-Prompt.md`, draft a prompt that will create cards that will display the information in the `centers` dataset.\r\n2.  **Apply**: Send your prompt to the AI Assistant.\r\n3.  **Paste & Verify**: Copy the resulting JavaScript into `script.js` below the data.\r\n4.  **Check**: Verify that all 12 centers appear on the screen.\r\n\r\n",
